id: main
title: Type-only routing entry
description: >-
  Entry flow that must win a type-only messaging ingress. Named `main` so
  greentic-start's startup gate (`select_app_flow`) can pick an app flow at
  all — that gate only knows `default`/`main`/exactly-one-messaging and is
  blind to the `internal` tag, so an `entry_main` name aborts the boot before
  the runner's type-only resolver is ever reached. The routing assertion is
  unaffected: the gate only validates, and ingress still faces two messaging
  flows.
type: messaging
start: com_example_bug3-test
parameters: {}
tags: []
schema_version: 2
entrypoints: {}
nodes:
  com_example_bug3-test:
    routing: out
    probe:
      text: '{{in.input.text}}'
